    "description": "Apple internal set of over a thousand adversarial prompts on harmful content, sensitive topics and factuality, under Apple's safety policy. Human graders score each response. The 2024 AFM report gives the violation rate and a side-by-side safety preference against other models. The prompts are not public.",
